'''HVAC'''

# [[heating|Heating]], [[ventilation]] and [[air conditioning]]

====Usage notes====
Typically used adjectivally to describe equipment for performing heating, ventilation and air conditioning tasks, or the rooms which house such equipment, or the technicians who service such equipment, etc.

